  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "With increase in +ve charge, size of cation decreases.<br />With increase in -ve charge, size of anion increases.<br />Across the period, ionic size, decreases.&nbsp;<br />So correct order is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Li</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
